# Access rules of the TCP listener (port 1883). Copy this file to "acl" on
# the host (not in Git) and give every account of "pwfile" a block.

# Accounts that existed before the platform broker keep the access they had,
# which was everything (platform/broker: "Existing accounts keep their
# access"). The legacy services use this account:
user leoiot
topic readwrite #

# One block like this per further existing account (sensor boxes, PV
# collector, ...):
# user <account>
# topic readwrite #

# Sensors collector: reads everything, publishes only room climate
# (platform/broker: "New writer accounts publish only on their own topics").
user sensors-collector
topic read #
topic write leoiot/room-climate/#
